---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "Customised Productions | Flux Entertainment";
const description = "Fully bespoke productions from Flux Entertainment, combining fire, pyro, LED and more into one custom show — trusted by government, theme parks & major corporate clients.";
---
<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <Fragment slot="page-style">
<style is:global>
  .svc-hero{
    position:relative; min-height:60vh; padding-top:140px; padding-bottom:60px; overflow:hidden;
    background:var(--void);
  }
  .svc-hero-video{position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; object-position:center 25%; z-index:0;}
  .svc-hero-overlay{
    position:absolute; inset:0; z-index:1;
    background:
      linear-gradient(to top, rgba(10,9,8,0.97) 0%, rgba(10,9,8,0.65) 55%, rgba(10,9,8,0.45) 100%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 60% at 75% 25%, rgba(140,26,26,0.35) 0%, rgba(10,9,8,0) 65%);
  }
  .svc-hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 5rem); color:var(--bone); max-width:820px;}
  .svc-breadcrumb{color:var(--ash-dim); font-size:0.82rem; margin-bottom:20px;}
  .svc-breadcrumb a{color:var(--ash-dim);}
  .svc-breadcrumb a:hover{color:var(--gold);}

  .svc-photo{
    aspect-ratio:3/4; background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 30% 20%, rgba(214,40,40,0.35), transparent 60%), var(--char-2);
    border:1px solid #2A231F;
  }
  .options-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:0; position:relative; z-index:2; margin-top:26px; max-width:640px;}
  .option-item{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid #29221E; color:var(--ash); font-size:0.98rem;}
  .option-item svg{width:18px; height:18px; color:var(--gold); flex-shrink:0;}

  .photo-row{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:20px; position:relative; z-index:2;}
  .photo-row .svc-photo{aspect-ratio:4/3;}

  .highlight-block{
    border-left:2px solid var(--flame); padding:6px 0 6px 28px; margin-top:50px;
    position:relative; z-index:2;
  }
  .highlight-block p{color:var(--ash); font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.6;}

  .sfx-callout{
    margin-top:50px; border:1px solid #2A231F; padding:32px; display:flex; align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between; gap:24px; flex-wrap:wrap; position:relative; z-index:2;
  }
  .sfx-callout p{color:var(--ash); max-width:560px; font-size:0.98rem;}
  .sfx-callout p strong{color:var(--bone);}

  @media (max-width:860px){
    .options-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .photo-row{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
    .about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  }
</style>
  </Fragment>
<main id="top">

  <!-- SERVICE HERO -->
  <section class="svc-hero">
    <video class="svc-hero-video" autoplay muted loop playsinline aria-label="Flux Entertainment custom production performance footage">
      <source src="https://videos.fluxentertainment.com.au/custom-hero.mp4" type="video/mp4">
    </video>
    <div class="svc-hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="mark-bg" style="top:-150px; right:-200px; opacity:0.3; z-index:1;"></div>
    <div class="wrap" style="position:relative; z-index:2;">
      <div class="svc-breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/#services">Entertainment</a> / Customised Productions</div>
      <span class="mono eyebrow">Entertainment</span>
      <h1 style="margin-top:18px;">Customised Productions</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub" style="margin-top:22px;">A completely custom show, production, or unique prop — built from the ground up for your event or creative project.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Book Now</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- STORY -->
  <section class="about" style="padding-top:70px; padding-bottom:50px;">
    <div class="mark-bg" style="top:10%; left:-350px; opacity:0.25;"></div>
    <div class="wrap about-grid">
      <div class="about-copy">
        <p>This is where everything Flux does comes together into one production. Rather than booking a single act, our biggest clients come to us with a brief — a brand, a story, a moment they need to land — and we build a show around it from the ground up, drawing on every discipline across the business: fire, pyrotechnics, LED, angle grinding, whip cracking, and more, combined into one cohesive production.</p>
        <p>These are typically our largest and longest-running contracts — the kind booked by government bodies, theme parks, and major corporate clients who need something no off-the-shelf act can deliver. You can see some of that work on our <a href="/about" style="color:var(--gold); text-decoration:underline;">About page</a>, where we've listed the productions we're proudest of.</p>
        <p>Every custom production starts with a conversation, not a package — audio and storyline design, custom-built pyrotechnic props, ground-based effects, and hybrid performances are all built specifically around your event, not pulled from a template. Occasionally that scope narrows right down to a single custom-built prop rather than a full production — if that's closer to what you need, we're happy to talk through it.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-ghost" style="display:inline-block; margin-top:10px;">Enquire About This Production</a>
      </div>
      <div class="svc-photo" style="overflow:hidden;">
        <video autoplay muted loop playsinline aria-label="Flux Entertainment custom production performer close-up" style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover;">
          <source src="https://videos.fluxentertainment.com.au/custom-jez.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        </video>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- AVAILABLE OPTIONS -->
  <section class="provide" style="padding-top:60px; background:
      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(10,9,8,0.6) 0%, rgba(10,9,8,0.92) 70%, var(--void) 100%),
      url('/images/2d87036491d0c8fa.jpg');
      background-size:cover; background-position:center; background-repeat:no-repeat;">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="mono eyebrow">What's Included</span>
        <h2 style="margin-top:18px;">Available Options</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="options-grid">
        <div class="option-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Ground-based special effects</div>
        <div class="option-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Audio / storyline design</div>
        <div class="option-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Custom-built pyrotechnic props</div>
        <div class="option-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Varying pyrotechnic &amp; fire effect choices</div>
        <div class="option-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Hybrid performances</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SHOWREEL -->
  <section style="background:var(--void); padding:90px 0;">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head" style="margin-bottom:36px;">
        <span class="mono eyebrow">See Us In Action</span>
        <h2 style="margin-top:18px;">The Full Show Reel</h2>
        <p>Four minutes of Flux at full scale — fire, fireworks, and production design in front of the country's biggest crowds.</p>
      </div>
      <div id="customShowreelBox" style="position:relative; width:100%; aspect-ratio:16/9; background:#000; border:1px solid #2A231F; overflow:hidden;">
        <div id="customShowreelPlaceholder" style="position:absolute; inset:0; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; background:var(--char-2);">
          <span class="mono" style="color:var(--ash-dim);">Loading...</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <button id="customUnmuteBtn" class="btn-ghost" style="display:none; margin-top:18px;">Unmute</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CLOSING -->
  <section style="padding-top:0; padding-bottom:70px; background:var(--char);">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="highlight-block">
        <p>Having worked with some of Australia's biggest names in private capacities, Flux Entertainment provides a dynamic entertainment excellence.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="sfx-callout">
        <p>Enhance your experience even further with <strong>Flux SFX</strong> — choreographed fireworks, flame effects, and stage effects that elevate any performance into something even more immersive.</p>
        <a href="https://www.fluxsfx.com.au" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-ghost">Explore Flux SFX</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TRUSTED BY -->
  <div class="trust" style="margin-top:0;">
    <div class="trust-label mono">Who We've Worked With</div>
    <div class="marquee-track">
      <div class="logo-box client"><img src="/images/057c0d093231835b.png" alt="ACT Government logo"></div>
      <div class="logo-box client"><img src="/images/2781323574911132.png" alt="Brisbane Heat logo"></div>
